      "explanation": "The skill does not declare required tool scopes (permissions) for file read and write operations, which are demonstrated in the code examples. If the skill system relies on explicit permission declarations to enforce least privilege, the skill may be granted excessive permissions (if the system defaults to allowing) or insufficient permissions (if the system defaults to denying), potentially causing security risks or operational failure. However, as the skill is documentation and does not execute code, the actual risk is low. The context of PDF processing makes these permissions expected, so the skill system should allow declaring them.",
